cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "alpaca.swift: Native language model inference for Apple Silicon"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Etheridge
    given-names: Torin
date-released: 2026-10-09
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/torinriley/Alpaca"
abstract: >-
  A from-scratch Swift and Metal inference runtime for Llama-family language models on Apple Silicon,
  with GGUF loading, Q8_0/Q4_0 quantised kernels, FlashAttention-style prefill, tensor-op GEMM and
  GPU-resident greedy decoding, validated against PyTorch and benchmarked against llama.cpp.
keywords: [llm-inference, metal, swift, apple-silicon, gguf, quantization, attention]
